  "solution": "1. 16 and 9\n\n__**216 ÷ 16**__ × 9 + 24 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __**13.5 × 9**__ + 24 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __**121.5**____** + 24**__ - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __**1**____**45.5 - 27**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 118.5 ≠ 126\n\n2. 27 and 9\n\n__**216 ÷ 27**__ × 16 + 24 - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __**8**____** × 16**__ + 24 - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __**128**____** + 24**__ - 9 = 126\n\n⇒ __**152**____** - 9**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 143 ≠ 126\n\n3. 24 and 27\n\n__**216 ÷ 9**__ × 16 + 27 - 24 = 126\n\n⇒ __**24 × 16**__ + 27 - 24 = 126\n\n⇒ __**384 + 27**__ - 24 = 126\n\n⇒ __**411 - 24**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 387 ≠ 126\n\n4. 9 and 24\n\n__**216 ÷ 24**__ × 16 + 9 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __**9**____** × 16**__ + 9 - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ __**144**____** + 9**__ - 27 = 126\n\n⇒ **__153__**__** - 27**__ = 126\n\n⇒ 126 = 126\n\nHence, '**9 and 24**' is the correct answer.",
